# =============================================================
# AquaMonitor API — 03: Leituras de Consumo
# =============================================================
# Pré-requisito: admin_token e sensor_id preenchidos em .env.json
# Após "Registrar leitura com anomalia", anote o alertId retornado
# =============================================================

### Listar leituras — todas (paginado)
GET {{base_url}}/api/WaterReadings?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Listar leituras — filtrar por sensor
GET {{base_url}}/api/WaterReadings?sensorId={{sensor_id}}&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Listar leituras — apenas anomalias
GET {{base_url}}/api/WaterReadings?anomaliesOnly=true&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Listar leituras — filtrar por período
GET {{base_url}}/api/WaterReadings?from=2026-01-01T00:00:00Z&to=2026-12-31T23:59:59Z
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Registrar leitura NORMAL (vazão abaixo do limiar — sem alerta)
# @name reading_normal
POST {{base_url}}/api/WaterReadings
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

{
  "sensorId": {{sensor_id}},
  "litersConsumed": 45.5,
  "flowRateLitersPerHour": 150.0
}

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Registrar leitura com DATA específica
POST {{base_url}}/api/WaterReadings
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

{
  "sensorId": {{sensor_id}},
  "litersConsumed": 80.0,
  "flowRateLitersPerHour": 200.0,
  "recordedAt": "2026-05-15T08:30:00Z"
}

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Registrar leitura com ANOMALIA — LOW (vazão 1.2x o limiar)
# Limiar padrão: 300 L/h → 360 L/h = LOW
POST {{base_url}}/api/WaterReadings
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

{
  "sensorId": {{sensor_id}},
  "litersConsumed": 120.0,
  "flowRateLitersPerHour": 360.0
}

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Registrar leitura com ANOMALIA — MEDIUM (1.5x o limiar)
# Limiar: 300 → 480 L/h = MEDIUM
POST {{base_url}}/api/WaterReadings
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

{
  "sensorId": {{sensor_id}},
  "litersConsumed": 200.0,
  "flowRateLitersPerHour": 480.0
}

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Registrar leitura com ANOMALIA — HIGH (2x o limiar)
# Limiar: 300 → 650 L/h = HIGH
POST {{base_url}}/api/WaterReadings
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

{
  "sensorId": {{sensor_id}},
  "litersConsumed": 350.0,
  "flowRateLitersPerHour": 650.0
}

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Registrar leitura com ANOMALIA — CRITICAL (3x+ o limiar)
# Limiar: 300 → 1200 L/h = CRITICAL → guarde o alertId retornado!
# @name reading_critical
POST {{base_url}}/api/WaterReadings
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

{
  "sensorId": {{sensor_id}},
  "litersConsumed": 900.0,
  "flowRateLitersPerHour": 1200.0
}

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Resumo de consumo — todos os sensores
GET {{base_url}}/api/WaterReadings/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Resumo de consumo — sensor específico
GET {{base_url}}/api/WaterReadings/summary?sensorId={{sensor_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Resumo de consumo — com filtro de período
GET {{base_url}}/api/WaterReadings/summary?from=2026-01-01T00:00:00Z&to=2026-12-31T23:59:59Z
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Leitura com sensor inexistente (espera 404)
POST {{base_url}}/api/WaterReadings
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

{
  "sensorId": 99999,
  "litersConsumed": 10.0,
  "flowRateLitersPerHour": 50.0
}

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Leitura com dados inválidos (espera 400)
POST {{base_url}}/api/WaterReadings
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

{
  "sensorId": 0,
  "litersConsumed": -1.0,
  "flowRateLitersPerHour": -10.0
}
